#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's open-source content {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"
msgstr "Konten sumber terbuka IBM Quantum {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM provides a wealth of quantum computing learning material — all open "
"source under CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM menyediakan banyak materi pembelajaran komputasi kuantum — semua sumber "
"terbuka di bawah CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Structured courses "
"from quantum basics to advanced topics\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Kursus terstruktur "
"dari dasar kuantum hingga topik lanjutan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — 40+ "
"tutorials on transpilation, error mitigation, and more\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — Lebih "
"dari 40 tutorials tentang transpilation, error mitigation, dan lainnya\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Guides "
"and API reference for Qiskit\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Panduan "
"dan referensi API untuk Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — All content on "
"GitHub\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — Semua konten di"
" GitHub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Their [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) is always up-to-date"
" and well-designed — the best place for reading, learning, and reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) mereka selalu up-to-date "
"dan dirancang dengan baik — tempat terbaik untuk membaca, belajar, dan "
"referensi.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What this project adds {#what-this-project-adds}"
msgstr "Apa yang ditambahkan proyek ini {#what-this-project-adds}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM's [Qiskit documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) is "
"open source (CC BY-SA 4.0), but their web application is not. doQumentation "
"adds an open-source frontend with live code execution, automatic credential "
"injection, and simulator mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Dokumentasi Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) IBM adalah "
"sumber terbuka (CC BY-SA 4.0), tetapi aplikasi web mereka tidak. "
"doQumentation menambahkan frontend sumber terbuka dengan eksekusi kode "
"langsung, injeksi kredensial otomatis, dan mode simulator.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deployable anywhere — from [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) to "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" to [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). See [all features](/features).\n"
msgstr ""
"Bisa di-deploy di mana saja — dari [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)"
" hingga "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" hingga [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). Lihat [semua "
"fitur](/features).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When you're ready for more {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"
msgstr "Saat Anda siap untuk lebih banyak lagi {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation helps you take your **first steps with Qiskit** — read, run "
"code, and explore — without installing anything. As you progress, head to "
"IBM's official platform:\n"
msgstr ""
"doQumentation membantu Anda mengambil **langkah pertama dengan Qiskit** — "
"membaca, menjalankan kode, dan menjelajah — tanpa perlu menginstal apa pun. "
"Saat Anda maju, kunjungi platform resmi IBM:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Run on real hardware** — create a free [IBM Cloud "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) and an Open Plan "
"instance to execute circuits on real quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jalankan di perangkat keras nyata** — buat [akun IBM "
"Cloud](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) gratis dan instans Open "
"Plan untuk mengeksekusi sirkuit pada komputer kuantum sungguhan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Latest content** — IBM's [Qiskit learning "
"platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) has the newest courses, "
"tutorials, and additions (some may not yet be in doQumentation).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Konten terbaru** — [platform pembelajaran "
"Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) IBM memiliki kursus, "
"tutorial, dan tambahan terbaru (beberapa mungkin belum ada di "
"doQumentation).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Develop locally** — [install "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) on your own "
"laptop for serious development work.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mengembangkan secara lokal** — [instal "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) di laptop Anda "
"sendiri untuk pekerjaan pengembangan yang serius.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Built on [IBM Quantum's open-source "
"documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Thanks to the IBM "
"Quantum team for making this content freely available under CC BY-SA 4.0.*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Dibangun di atas [dokumentasi sumber terbuka IBM "
"Quantum](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Terima kasih kepada tim "
"IBM Quantum karena telah menyediakan konten ini secara bebas di bawah CC BY-"
"SA 4.0.*\n"

