#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Eksekusi kode {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Klik **Run** pada blok kode mana pun. Klik pertama memulai kernel Jupyter "
"melalui [Binder](https://mybinder.org) atau [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-"
"settings#code-engine). Setelah itu, eksekusi langsung.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mode Simulator (tidak perlu akun)** — Aktifkan [Mode Simulator](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) untuk menjalankan semua notebook dengan "
"AerSimulator atau FakeBackends model noise. Tidak perlu setup sama sekali.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hardware IBM Quantum** — Masukkan token API dan CRN Anda di "
"[Pengaturan](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) sekali — kredensial disuntikkan "
"otomatis setiap kali dijalankan. [Buat akun "
"gratis](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) jika belum punya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backend eksekusi yang tersedia</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Setiap tutorial punya blok kode yang bisa dieksekusi. Klik **Run** untuk "
"menjalankannya menggunakan salah satu dari empat backend:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (default di GitHub Pages) — Kernel Jupyter jarak jauh gratis "
"melalui [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless di akun IBM Cloud Anda. Cold start "
"dalam detik, bukan menit. [Setup](/jupyter-settings#code-engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jupyter Lokal (Docker / RasQberry)** — Terhubung ke server Jupyter lokal "
"dengan Qiskit sudah terinstal\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Server kustom** — Arahkan ke endpoint Jupyter mana pun di "
"[Pengaturan](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Saat beberapa backend tersedia, pilih yang mana dari [Pengaturan](/jupyter-"
"settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opsi deployment</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation tersedia sebagai:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Situs statis dengan "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) atau [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-"
"settings#code-engine) untuk eksekusi kode jarak jauh\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack secara lokal, bisa offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
